 Feeds added inside Liferea are not persisted; edit the Nix file and rebuild.
 A host can extend or replace the list by setting the `feeds` option.
 
+## ROCCAT Kone Aimo
+
+`features.hardware.kone-aimo.enable` installs the
+[Kone Aimo app](https://github.com/phiph-s/roccat-kone-aimo-linux) and its udev rule.
+The rule gives the local seat user access to the mouse (USB `1e7d:2e2c`) without root.
+The source is the pinned flake input `kone-aimo-src`; the package is in
+`modules/features/hardware/_kone-aimo-package.nix`.
+
+Before the first change, save the 5 on-mouse profiles. Run `kone-aimo-backup`
+in a directory of your choice. It writes `backups/profiles-<date>.json` there.
+
+To update, change the commit in the `kone-aimo-src` URL in `flake.nix`, then run
+`nix flake update kone-aimo-src`. Review the new upstream diff first.
+
